      {
        "step": "six_explicit_aliases_UI",
        "text": "标签表示、唯一源对象与候选关系\n\n窗内4个几何表示 / 3个唯一对象；完整主表5个表示 / 4个唯一对象。公园way的线和面来自同一对象，不累计为两处公园。\n\n源 node 2709174920 · 1种表示\n源 node 5612731872 · 1种表示\n源 node 6682523037 · 1种表示\n源 way 116486191 · 2种表示\nsource_object_key\nOSM2021@sha256:d83436cd414db196d164fc35990910d6369347c6c47192ed6d79ffcfb2335f78/way/116486191\nobject_type\nway\nobject_id\n116486191\nsource_version\n4\nobject_last_edit_raw_unix_seconds\n1604832107\nobject_last_edit_utc\n2020-11-08T10:41:47+00:00\nmark_groups_json\n[\"open_space_tag\"]\nraw_tags_json\n{\"@id\": 116486191, \"@timestamp\": 1604832107, \"@type\": \"way\", \"@version\": 4, \"leisure\": \"park\", \"name\": \"望江楼公园\", \"name:en\": \"Wangjiang Park\", \"name:zh\": \"望江楼公园\"}\nactual_destination_or_entrance\n空项（原字符串）\nlegal_public_access\n空项（原字符串）\nsource_feature_keys_json\n[\"OSM2021@sha256:d83436cd414db196d164fc35990910d6369347c6c47192ed6d79ffcfb2335f78/way/116486191/LineString\", \"OSM2021@sha256:d83436cd414db196d164fc35990910d6369347c6c47192ed6d79ffcfb2335f78/way/116486191/MultiPolygon\"]\ngeometry_types_json\n[\"LineString\", \"MultiPolygon\"]\ncontext_relations_json\n[\"positive_length_context\", \"positive_area_context\"]\n查看此唯一对象的全部窗内表示\n\n两个标签点与原81节点精确匹配；这仅证明来源身份一致。9条源点 / 候选受体与公园的原平面关系均在投影外；角色、合法进入、路线与服务仍为空。\n\n六条显式SHA / layer / ID别名证据\n[\n  {\n    \"source_mark_relation_subject_key\": \"micro_scene@sha256:6e852b128a3378dbe314b06885eec45a683387cf3c99ccda9bedc2b0a740a4f4/receptor_candidates/H1\",\n    \"SVF_receptor_key\": \"6e852b128a3378dbe314b06885eec45a683387cf3c99ccda9bedc2b0a740a4f4/receptor_candidates/H1\",\n    \"binding_basis\": \"same full SHA256, receptor_candidates layer, original ID; explicit prefix alias, not bare-ID matching\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"source_mark_relation_subject_key\": \"micro_scene@sha256:6e852b128a3378dbe314b06885eec45a683387cf3c99ccda9bedc2b0a740a4f4/receptor_candidates/H2\",\n    \"SVF_receptor_key\": \"6e852b128a3378dbe314b06885eec45a683387cf3c99ccda9bedc2b0a740a4f4/receptor_candidates/H2\",\n    \"